├── It when batch is empty
├── It when batch exceeds max batch
├── It when transact params length mismatches
├── It when note data length mismatches
├── It when an item has zero withdrawal
├── It when recipient is zero
├── It when an item has a different asset
├── It when an item has a different recipient
├── It when an item has a different fee recipient
├── It when an item fee exceeds max relay fee
├── It when an item fee exceeds its withdrawal
